{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026S3s41LpWaP1792656943.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>宏福苑火災獨立委員會向行政長官李家超提交報告。李家超稱會仔細研究，短期內公布全面改革計劃和如何追究責任。消息指，報告點名四個政府部門失職，其中房屋局獨立審查組責任最大。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202139-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E6%93%9A%E6%82%89%E7%8D%A8%E7%AB%8B%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1%E6%9C%83%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E9%BB%9E%E5%90%8D%E5%9B%9B%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E9%83%A8%E9%96%80%E5%A4%B1%E8%81%B7%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E5%B1%80%E7%8D%A8%E7%AB%8B%E5%AF%A9%E6%9F%A5%E7%B5%84%E8%B2%AC%E4%BB%BB%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>宏福苑｜據悉獨立委員會報告點名四政府部門失職　房屋局獨立審查組責任最大</strong></a></p><p></p><p>有調查顯示，本港企業今年平均加薪百分之2.3，預料明年加幅是百分之3.1。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202137-%E5%A4%A7%E7%81%A3%E5%8D%80%E4%BC%81%E6%A5%AD%E8%96%AA%E9%85%AC%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5%E6%9C%AC%E6%B8%AF%E4%BC%81%E6%A5%AD%E4%BB%8A%E5%B9%B4%E5%B9%B3%E5%9D%87%E5%8A%A0%E8%96%AA23%E6%96%99%E6%98%8E%E5%B9%B4%E5%8A%A0%E5%B9%85%E7%82%BA31\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>大灣區企業薪酬調查：本港企業今年平均加薪2.3%　料明年加幅為3.1%</strong></a></p><p></p><p>本港自6月下旬進入流感季節後，錄得25宗兒童感染流感嚴重個案，累計兩名兒童死亡。衞生防護中心表示，流感活躍程度未有下降趨勢，預期今年夏季流感高峰期會較長，呼籲盡快接種疫苗。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202111-%E8%A1%9E%E7%94%9F%E9%98%B2%E8%AD%B7%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E9%A0%90%E6%9C%9F%E4%BB%8A%E5%B9%B4%E5%A4%8F%E5%AD%A3%E6%B5%81%E6%84%9F%E9%AB%98%E5%B3%B0%E6%9C%9F%E8%BC%83%E9%95%B7%E7%B1%B2%E7%9B%A1%E5%BF%AB%E6%8E%A5%E7%A8%AE%E7%96%AB%E8%8B%97\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>衞生防護中心預期今年夏季流感高峰期較長　籲盡快接種疫苗</strong></a></p><p></p><p>港珠澳大橋開通八周年，累計接待逾1.25億人次旅客，車輛逾2,645萬架次。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1202150-%E6%B8%AF%E7%8F%A0%E6%BE%B3%E5%A4%A7%E6%A9%8B%E9%96%8B%E9%80%9A%E5%85%AB%E5%91%A8%E5%B9%B4%E7%B4%AF%E8%A8%88%E6%8E%A5%E5%BE%85%E9%80%BE125%E5%84%84%E4%BA%BA%E6%AC%A1%E6%97%85%E5%AE%A2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>港珠澳大橋開通八周年　累計接待逾1.25億人次旅客</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:05.479776+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":392,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.246562+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:48.100354+00:00","content_hash":"99502ed98956eb62b2cc439ac10b9e46d840c4b08f4b214a3063d16439a5f9f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:05.479776+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}